Flash Next EXL3 packs (turboderp's) on the native CUDA engine: dense projections (stitched DeltaNet and attention inputs, the head, the MTP head's fc layers) on the EXL3 linear, routed experts with the shared expert as expert 512 on the grouped EXL3 kernels, the f16 tensors the pack leaves unquantized as bf16 (hyper-connections, router, in_proj_a/b, n-gram key/value projections), the consolidated n-gram table (one int16 trellis, ExLlamaV3's ngram_dequant row codec, decoded on the host), the MTP head with its draft vocabulary decoded through the EXL3 head. New files cuda_exl3_*.zig beside the family's loader; config.json quant_method exl3 is admitted; format "exl3". Verified: greedy replies with and without MTP drafts hash the same.

